  - name: PATIENTSURVEY_DICT.Q1_IS_PATIENT
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN: |
            <p>1. Before we begin, to confirm, are you the patient?</p>
          FIL: |
            <p>Bago kami magsimula, upang makumpirma, kayo ba ang pasyente?</p>
          BCL: |
            <p>Bago kita mag-poon, para makumpirma: ika po ba an pasyente?</p>
          BIS: |
            <p>Sa dili pa kita magsugod, aron makumpirma, ikaw ba ang pasyente?</p>
          CEB: |
            <p>Sa wala pa ta magsugod, gusto lang nako ma-confirm – ikaw ba ang pasyente?</p>
          WAR: |
            <p>Antes kita magtikang, para la makasiguro, ikaw ba an pasyente?</p>
          HIL: |
            <p>Antes kita magsugod, agud makumpirma, ikaw bala ang pasyente?</p>
          ILO: |
            <p>Sakbay a mangrugitayo, tapno mapasingkedan, sika kadi ti pasiente?</p>
  - name: PATIENTSURVEY_DICT.Q2_RELATIONSHIP
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN: |
            <p>2. What is your relationship to the patient?</p>
          FIL: |
            <p>Ano ang inyong relasyon sa pasyente?</p>
          BCL: |
            <p>Ano an relasyon mo sa pasyente?</p>
          BIS: |
            <p>Unsa ang imong relasyon sa pasyente?</p>
          CEB: |
            <p>Unsa imong relasyon sa pasyente?</p>
          WAR: |
            <p>Ano an imo relasyon ha pasyente?</p>
          HIL: |
            <p>Ano ang imo relasyon sa pasyente?</p>
          ILO: |
            <p>Ania ti relasionyo iti pasiente?</p>
  - name: PATIENTSURVEY_DICT.Q2_RELATIONSHIP_OTHER_TXT
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN: |
            <p>2. Relationship — Other (specify) text</p>
          FIL: |
            <p>Iba pa (Tukuyin)</p>
          BCL: |
            <p>2. Relationship — Other (specify) text</p>
          BIS: |
            <p>2. Relationship — Other (specify) text</p>
          CEB: |
            <p>Uban pa (isulti)</p>
          WAR: |
            <p>2. Relationship — Other (specify) text</p>
          HIL: |
            <p>2. Relationship — Other (specify) text</p>
          ILO: |
            <p>2. Relationship — Other (specify) text</p>
  - name: PATIENTSURVEY_DICT.Q3_SAME_HOUSE
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN: |
            <p>3. Do you live in the same house as the patient?</p>
          FIL: |
            <p>Nakatira ba kayo sa parehong bahay ng pasyente?</p>
          BCL: |
            <p>Nakaistar ba kamo sa sarong harong parehas kan pasyente?</p>
          BIS: |
            <p>Nagpuyo ba ka sa parehas nga balay uban sa pasyente?</p>
          CEB: |
            <p>Nagpuyo ba ka sa pareho nga balay sa pasyente?</p>
          WAR: |
            <p>Kaupod mo ba ha balay an pasyente?</p>
          HIL: |
            <p>Nagapuyo ka bala sa amo man nga balay upod sang pasyente?</p>
          ILO: |
            <p>Agnanaedka kadi iti maymaysa a balay a kaduam ti pasiente?</p>
  - name: PATIENTSURVEY_DICT.Q4_NAME
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN: |
            <p>Before proceeding to the survey proper, we would like to ask the patient about their personal information.</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for the Patient Profile. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies.</p><p>4. Patient's Name (Last Name, First Name, MI, Extension)</p>
          FIL: |
            <p>information Bago magpatuloy sa mismong sarbey, nais naming tanungin ang pasyente tungkol sa kanilang personal na impormasyon</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for the Patient Profile. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies.</p><p>4. Patient's Name (Last Name, First Name, MI, Extension)</p>
          BCL: |
            <p>information Bako magpuon sa survey, mahapot kami sa pasyente manungod sa saiyang persona na impormasyon</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for the Patient Profile. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies.</p><p>4. Patient's Name (Last Name, First Name, MI, Extension)</p>
          BIS: |
            <p>information Sa dili pa kita mopadayon sa aktuwal nga survey, gusto namo mangayo og impormasyon bahin sa personal nga datos sa pasyente</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for the Patient Profile. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies.</p><p>4. Patient's Name (Last Name, First Name, MI, Extension)</p>
          CEB: |
            <p>Before proceeding to the survey proper, we would like to ask the patient about their personal information.</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for the Patient Profile. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies.</p><p>4. Patient's Name (Last Name, First Name, MI, Extension)</p>
          WAR: |
            <p>information Antes magpakadto ini nga surbey, karuyag namon pakianhan an pasyente mahitungod han ira personal nga impormasyon</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for the Patient Profile. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies.</p><p>4. Patient's Name (Last Name, First Name, MI, Extension)</p>
          HIL: |
            <p>Before proceeding to the survey proper, we would like to ask the patient about their personal information.</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for the Patient Profile. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies.</p><p>4. Patient's Name (Last Name, First Name, MI, Extension)</p>
          ILO: |
            <p>information (Sakbay nga agtultuloykami iti surbey proper, kayatmi a damagen iti pasiente ti maipapan iti personal nga impormasionda) Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for th</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for the Patient Profile. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies.</p><p>4. Patient's Name (Last Name, First Name, MI, Extension)</p>
  - name: PATIENTSURVEY_DICT.Q5_BIRTH_MONTH
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN: |
            <p>5. In what month was the patient born?</p>
          FIL: |
            <p>5. In what month was the patient born?</p>
          BCL: |
            <p>5. In what month was the patient born?</p>
          BIS: |
            <p>5. In what month was the patient born?</p>
          CEB: |
            <p>5. In what month was the patient born?</p>
          WAR: |
            <p>5. In what month was the patient born?</p>
          HIL: |
            <p>5. In what month was the patient born?</p>
          ILO: |
            <p>5. In what month was the patient born?</p>
  - name: PATIENTSURVEY_DICT.Q5_BIRTH_YEAR
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN: |
            <p>5. In what year was the patient born?</p>
          FIL: |
            <p>5. In what year was the patient born?</p>
          BCL: |
            <p>5. In what year was the patient born?</p>
          BIS: |
            <p>5. In what year was the patient born?</p>
          CEB: |
            <p>5. In what year was the patient born?</p>
          WAR: |
            <p>5. In what year was the patient born?</p>
          HIL: |
