  - name: PATIENTSURVEY_DICT.Q29_SEC_CLASS
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN: |
            <p>How would the socioeconomic class of the patient's household be classified?</p><p class="instruction">Please choose one from the options I will mention.</p>
          FIL: |
            <p>Paano ilalarawan ang antas ng socio-economic class ng sambahayan ng pasyente?</p><p class="instruction">Please choose one from the options I will mention.</p>
          BCL: |
            <p>Pano an sosyo-ekonomiko na klase kan saindong pamilya?</p><p class="instruction">Please choose one from the options I will mention.</p>
          BIS: |
            <p>Unsay socioeconomic class sa panimalay sa pasyente?</p><p class="instruction">Please choose one from the options I will mention.</p>
          CEB: |
            <p>Unsaon pag-classify ang socioeconomic nga klase sa panimalay sa pasyente?</p><p class="instruction">Please choose one from the options I will mention.</p>
          WAR: |
            <p>Paonan-o igklasipikar an sosyo-ekonomiko nga klase han panimalay han pasyente?</p><p class="instruction">Please choose one from the options I will mention.</p>
          HIL: |
            <p>Paano pagaklasipikaron ang sosyoekonomiko nga klase sang panimalay sang pasyente? Please choose one from the options I will mention. Palihog pilii ang isa sa mga opsyon nga akon pagamention</p><p class="instruction">Please choose one from the options I will mention.</p>
          ILO: |
            <p>Kasano koma a mailasin ti sosioekonomiko a klase ti sangakabbalayan ti pasiente?) Please choose one from the options I will mention. (Pangngaasiyo ta agpilikayo iti maysa manipud kadagiti pagpilian a dakamatek.</p><p class="instruction">Please choose one from the options I will mention.</p>
  - name: PATIENTSURVEY_DICT.Q30_IP
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN: |
            <p>30. Is the patient member of Indigenous People (IP) community, like the Igorot, Lumad, Mangyans, etc.?</p>
