  - name: PATIENTSURVEY_DICT.Q32_4PS
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN: |
            <p>32. Is the patient's household a beneficiary of the Pantawid Pamilyang Pilipino Program (4Ps)?</p>
          FIL: |
            <p>Ang sambahayan ba ng pasyente ay benepisyaryo ng Pantawid Pamilyang Pilipino Program (4Ps)?</p>
          BCL: |
            <p>An pamilya ba kan pasyente ay benepisyaryo kan 4Ps?</p>
          BIS: |
            <p>Benepisyaryo ba ang panimalay sa pasyente sa Pantawid Pamilyang Pilipino Program (4Ps)?</p>
          CEB: |
            <p>Ang panimalay ba sa pasyente usa ka benepisyaryo sa Pantawid Pamilyang Pilipino Program (4Ps)?</p>
          WAR: |
            <p>An panimalay ba han pasyente usa nga benepisyaryo han Pantawid Pamilyang Pilipino Program (4Ps)?</p>
          HIL: |
            <p>Benepisyaryo bala ang panimalay sang pasyente sang Pantawid Pamilyang Pilipino Program (4Ps)?</p>
          ILO: |
            <p>Ti kadi sangakabbalayan ti pasiente ket benepisiario ti Pantawid Pamilyang Pilipino Program (4Ps)?</p>
  - name: PATIENTSURVEY_DICT.Q33_DECISION_MAKER
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN: |
            <p>33. Is the patient the main decision-maker on health care in your household?</p><p class="instruction">The decision-maker is the person that takes responsibility on decisions regarding health in the family: for example, yearly immunizations, hospital finances, etc.</p>
          FIL: |
            <p>Ang pasyente ba ang pangunahing nagpapasya tungkol sa pangangalagang pangkalusugan sa inyong sambahayan?</p><p class="instruction">The decision-maker is the person that takes responsibility on decisions regarding health in the family: for example, yearly immunizations, hospital finances, etc.</p>
          BCL: |
            <p>An pasyente ba an pangunahing nagdedesisyon sa healthcare sa inyong harong?</p><p class="instruction">The decision-maker is the person that takes responsibility on decisions regarding health in the family: for example, yearly immunizations, hospital finances, etc.</p>
          BIS: |
            <p>Ang pasyente ba ang pangunahing tigdesisyon bahin sa health care sa inyong panimalay?</p><p class="instruction">The decision-maker is the person that takes responsibility on decisions regarding health in the family: for example, yearly immunizations, hospital finances, etc.</p>
          CEB: |
            <p>Ang pasyente ba ang nag-unang tigdumala sa mga desisyon bahin sa pag-atiman sa panglawas sa inyong panimalay?</p><p class="instruction">The decision-maker is the person that takes responsibility on decisions regarding health in the family: for example, yearly immunizations, hospital finances, etc.</p>
          WAR: |
            <p>An pasyente ba an nangunguna nga nagdidesisyon ha pag-ataman han kahimsog ha iyo panimalay?</p><p class="instruction">The decision-maker is the person that takes responsibility on decisions regarding health in the family: for example, yearly immunizations, hospital finances, etc.</p>
          HIL: |
            <p>Ang pasyente bala ang pangunahing naga-desisyon sa pag-atipan sang kabuhi sa inyo panimalay? The decision-maker is the person that takes responsibility on decisions regarding health in the family: for example, yearly immunizations, hospital finances, etc. Ang naga-desisyon amo ang tawo nga nagakumiter sang responsibilidad sa mga desisyon bahin sa kahimsog sa pamilya: pananglitan, tinuig nga bakuna, gastusan sa ospital, kag iban pa</p><p class="instruction">The decision-maker is the person that takes responsibility on decisions regarding health in the family: for example, yearly immunizations, hospital finances, etc.</p>
          ILO: |
            <p>33. Is the patient the main decision-maker on health care in your household?</p><p class="instruction">The decision-maker is the person that takes responsibility on decisions regarding health in the family: for example, yearly immunizations, hospital finances, etc.</p>
  - name: PATIENTSURVEY_DICT.Q34_WHO_DECIDES
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN: |
            <p>34. Who takes the most responsibility for making the decisions regarding healthcare in the patient's household?</p><p class="instruction">READ OPTIONS OUT LOUD. SELECT ONE ANSWER ONLY. This is the person who makes decisions on health in the family: for example, yearly immunizations, manages hospital finances, etc.</p>
          FIL: |
            <p>34. Who takes the most responsibility for making the decisions regarding healthcare in the patient's household?</p><p class="instruction">READ OPTIONS OUT LOUD. SELECT ONE ANSWER ONLY. This is the person who makes decisions on health in the family: for example, yearly immunizations, manages hospital finances, etc.</p>
          BCL: |
            <p>34. Who takes the most responsibility for making the decisions regarding healthcare in the patient's household?</p><p class="instruction">READ OPTIONS OUT LOUD. SELECT ONE ANSWER ONLY. This is the person who makes decisions on health in the family: for example, yearly immunizations, manages hospital finances, etc.</p>
          BIS: |
