          ILO: |
            <p>34. Who takes the most responsibility for making the decisions regarding healthcare in the patient's household?</p><p class="instruction">READ OPTIONS OUT LOUD. SELECT ONE ANSWER ONLY. This is the person who makes decisions on health in the family: for example, yearly immunizations, manages hospital finances, etc.</p>
