          BIS: |
            <p>Mangutana na usab kami bahin sa kahibalo sa pasyente sa Universal Health Care (UHC)</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for the Patient’s awareness on Universal Health Care. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies.</p><p>35. Have you heard about Universal Health Care (UHC) prior to this survey?</p>
          CEB: |
            <p>We will now ask about the patient’s awareness of the Universal Health Care (UHC).</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for the Patient’s awareness on Universal Health Care. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies.</p><p>35. Have you heard about Universal Health Care (UHC) prior to this survey?</p>
          WAR: |
            <p>Magpapakiana kita yana mahitungod han kahibaro han pasyente mahitungod han Universal Health Care (UHC)</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for the Patient’s awareness on Universal Health Care. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies.</p><p>35. Have you heard about Universal Health Care (UHC) prior to this survey?</p>
