  - name: PATIENTSURVEY_DICT.Q38_PHILHEALTH_REG
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN: |
            <p>The next questions we will be asking are related to the patient’s PhilHealth registration experience. We will also confirm their PhilHealth registration status and membership, and their registration to other health insurance.</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for the Patient’s PhilHealth Registration and Health Insurance. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies.</p><p>38. Are you currently registered with PhilHealth?</p>
          FIL: |
            <p>Ang mga susunod na tanong ay tungkol sa karanasan ng pasyente sa pagpaparehistro sa PhilHealth. Kukumpirmahin din namin ang status ng pagpaparehistro at pagiging miyembro sa PhilHealth, pati na rin ang kanilang pagpaparehistro sa iba pang health insurance.</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for the Patient’s PhilHealth Registration and Health Insurance. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies.</p><p>38. Are you currently registered with PhilHealth?</p>
          BCL: |
            <p>An masunod na kahapotan ay manungod sa pasyente na may Philhealth resigtration na saimong naeksperyensa</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for the Patient’s PhilHealth Registration and Health Insurance. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies.</p><p>38. Are you currently registered with PhilHealth?</p>
          BIS: |
            <p>Ang sunod nga mga pangutana kabahin sa kasinatian sa pasyente sa pagparehistro sa PhilHealth</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for the Patient’s PhilHealth Registration and Health Insurance. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies.</p><p>38. Are you currently registered with PhilHealth?</p>
          CEB: |
            <p>The next questions we will be asking are related to the patient’s PhilHealth registration experience. We will also confirm their PhilHealth registration status and membership, and their registration to other health insurance.</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for the Patient’s PhilHealth Registration and Health Insurance. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies.</p><p>38. Are you currently registered with PhilHealth?</p>
          WAR: |
            <p>An sunod nga mga pakiana nga aton igpapakiana in may kalabutan han eksperyensya han pasyente ha pagparehistro ha PhilHealth</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for the Patient’s PhilHealth Registration and Health Insurance. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies.</p><p>38. Are you currently registered with PhilHealth?</p>
          HIL: |
            <p>Ang masunod nga mga pamangkot nga aton ipamangkot kalabot sa eksperyensya sang pasyente sa pagparehistro sa PhilHealth</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for the Patient’s PhilHealth Registration and Health Insurance. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies.</p><p>38. Are you currently registered with PhilHealth?</p>
          ILO: |
            <p>(Dagiti sumaruno a saludsod nga isaludsodmi ket mainaig iti padas ti pasiente iti panagrehistro iti PhilHealth</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for the Patient’s PhilHealth Registration and Health Insurance. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies.</p><p>38. Are you currently registered with PhilHealth?</p>
