  - name: PATIENTSURVEY_DICT.Q971_SOURCES
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN: |
            <p>97.1 Other than the expenses above (e.g. consultation, laboratory tests, prescribed medicines, etc.), which of the following were also included in the bill? How much were you charged or billed?</p><p class="instruction">If patient provides a receipt, select all that apply. If no receipt was provided, read options out loud. Select all that apply.</p>
          FIL: |
            <p>97.1 Other than the expenses above (e.g. consultation, laboratory tests, prescribed medicines, etc.), which of the following were also included in the bill? How much were you charged or billed?</p><p class="instruction">Kung ang pasyente ay nagbigay ng resibo, piliin ang lahat na naaangkop. Kung walang resibo, basahin ang mga opsyon nang malakas. Piliin ang lahat na naaangkop</p>
          BCL: |
            <p>97.1 Other than the expenses above (e.g. consultation, laboratory tests, prescribed medicines, etc.), which of the following were also included in the bill? How much were you charged or billed?</p><p class="instruction">Kun an pasyente may resibo pilion an dapat. Kun wara man na maitao, basahon asin pilion an mga dapat na kasimbagan</p>
          BIS: |
            <p>97.1 Other than the expenses above (e.g. consultation, laboratory tests, prescribed medicines, etc.), which of the following were also included in the bill? How much were you charged or billed?</p><p class="instruction">If patient provides a receipt, select all that apply. If no receipt was provided, read options out loud. Select all that apply.</p>
          CEB: |
            <p>97.1 Other than the expenses above (e.g. consultation, laboratory tests, prescribed medicines, etc.), which of the following were also included in the bill? How much were you charged or billed?</p><p class="instruction">If patient provides a receipt, select all that apply. If no receipt was provided, read options out loud. Select all that apply.</p>
          WAR: |
            <p>97.1 Other than the expenses above (e.g. consultation, laboratory tests, prescribed medicines, etc.), which of the following were also included in the bill? How much were you charged or billed?</p><p class="instruction">Kun an pasyente maghatag hin resibo, pilia an ngatanan nga aplikado. Kon waray iginhatag nga resibo, basaha ha daku nga tingog an mga opsyon. Pilia an ngatanan nga aplikado</p>
          HIL: |
            <p>97.1 Other than the expenses above (e.g. consultation, laboratory tests, prescribed medicines, etc.), which of the following were also included in the bill? How much were you charged or billed?</p><p class="instruction">If patient provides a receipt, select all that apply. If no receipt was provided, read options out loud. Select all that apply.</p>
          ILO: |
            <p>97.1 Other than the expenses above (e.g. consultation, laboratory tests, prescribed medicines, etc.), which of the following were also included in the bill? How much were you charged or billed?</p><p class="instruction">If patient provides a receipt, select all that apply. If no receipt was provided, read options out loud. Select all that apply.</p>
