  - name: PATIENTSURVEY_DICT.Q99_BUCAS_HEARD
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN: |
            <p>We will now ask about the patient’s awareness about BUCAS and the services they accessed in a BUCAS Center.</p><p class="instruction">Q99 to Q103 are applicable only to respondents in areas with BUCAS center. Otherwise, skip.</p><p>99. Have you heard about Bagong Urgent Care and Ambulatory Services (BUCAS) center?</p>
          FIL: |
            <p>Magtatanong kami ngayon tungkol sa kaalaman ng pasyente sa BUCAS at sa mga serbisyong natanggap sa isang BUCAS Center.</p><p class="instruction">Q99 to Q103 are applicable only to respondents in areas with BUCAS center. Otherwise, skip.</p><p>99. Have you heard about Bagong Urgent Care and Ambulatory Services (BUCAS) center?</p>
          BCL: |
            <p>Mahapot na kami manungod sa saimong kaaraman manungod sa BUCAS asin iba pang serbisyo na igwa kang access sa BUCAS Center Q99 to Q103 are applicable only to respondents in areas with BUCAS ce</p><p class="instruction">Q99 to Q103 are applicable only to respondents in areas with BUCAS center. Otherwise, skip.</p><p>99. Have you heard about Bagong Urgent Care and Ambulatory Services (BUCAS) center?</p>
          BIS: |
            <p>Mangutana na usab kami bahin sa kahibalo sa pasyente kabahin sa BUCAS ug sa mga serbisyo nga ilang nagamit sa usa ka BUCAS Center</p><p class="instruction">Q99 to Q103 are applicable only to respondents in areas with BUCAS center. Otherwise, skip.</p><p>99. Have you heard about Bagong Urgent Care and Ambulatory Services (BUCAS) center?</p>
          CEB: |
            <p>Mangutana na kami karon bahin sa kaamgohan sa pasyente mahitungod sa BUCAS ug sa mga serbisyo nga ilang nakuha sa usa ka BUCAS Center</p><p class="instruction">Q99 to Q103 are applicable only to respondents in areas with BUCAS center. Otherwise, skip.</p><p>99. Have you heard about Bagong Urgent Care and Ambulatory Services (BUCAS) center?</p>
          WAR: |
            <p>Magpapakiana kami yana mahitungod han hibaro han pasyente mahitungod han BUCAS ngan han mga serbisyo nga ira na-access ha usa nga BUCAS Center</p><p class="instruction">Q99 to Q103 are applicable only to respondents in areas with BUCAS center. Otherwise, skip.</p><p>99. Have you heard about Bagong Urgent Care and Ambulatory Services (BUCAS) center?</p>
          HIL: |
            <p>Mangabay kami subong parte sa pagkahibalo sang pasyente parte sa BUCAS kag ang mga serbisyo nga ila gin-access sa isa ka BUCAS Center</p><p class="instruction">Q99 to Q103 are applicable only to respondents in areas with BUCAS center. Otherwise, skip.</p><p>99. Have you heard about Bagong Urgent Care and Ambulatory Services (BUCAS) center?</p>
          ILO: |
            <p>We will now ask about the patient’s awareness about BUCAS and the services they accessed in a BUCAS Center.</p><p class="instruction">Q99 to Q103 are applicable only to respondents in areas with BUCAS center. Otherwise, skip.</p><p>99. Have you heard about Bagong Urgent Care and Ambulatory Services (BUCAS) center?</p>
