  - name: PATIENTSURVEY_DICT.Q101_BUCAS_UNDERSTAND
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN: |
            <p>101. What is your understanding about a BUCAS center?</p><p class="instruction">DO NOT READ OPTIONS OUT LOUD. SELECT ALL THAT APPLY.</p>
          FIL: |
            <p>101. What is your understanding about a BUCAS center?</p><p class="instruction">HUWAG BASAHIN NG MALAKAS ANG MGA OPSYON. PUMILI NG LAHAT NG NAANGKOP</p>
          BCL: |
            <p>101. What is your understanding about a BUCAS center?</p><p class="instruction">DAE PAGBASAHON NIN MAKSUOG. PILION AN DAPAT NA KASIMBAGAN</p>
          BIS: |
            <p>101. What is your understanding about a BUCAS center?</p><p class="instruction">AYAW BASAHA ANG MGA OPSYON. PILI-A ANG TANAN NGA PWEDE</p>
          CEB: |
            <p>101. What is your understanding about a BUCAS center?</p><p class="instruction">AYAW BASAHA UG KUSOG. PILIA ANG TANAN NGA MO APPLY</p>
          WAR: |
            <p>101. What is your understanding about a BUCAS center?</p><p class="instruction">AYAW PAGBASA HA MAKUSOG AN MGA OPSYON. PILIA AN TANAN NGA APLIKADO</p>
          HIL: |
            <p>101. What is your understanding about a BUCAS center?</p><p class="instruction">INDI PAGBASAHA ANG MGA OPSYON. PILIA ANG TANAN NGA NAGA‑KABAGAY</p>
          ILO: |
            <p>101. What is your understanding about a BUCAS center?</p><p class="instruction">(SAAN A BASAEN TI OPTIONS ITI NAIPAAY. PILIEN AMIN NGA AGaplikar.)</p>
