  - name: PATIENTSURVEY_DICT.Q113_SOURCES
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN: |
            <p>I would like to know where you got the money to pay for medical costs incurred (IN ___, and ____) at the (FACILITY TYPE INPUT).</p><p class="instruction">Enumerator Note: 'Quantified Free Service' fees are those directly charged to the hospital budget.</p><p>113. Which of the following did you use to pay for the hospital bill? (Select all that apply.)</p>
          FIL: |
            <p>___) Nais naming malaman kung saan nanggaling ang pera na ipinanambayad sa mga gastusing medikal (IN ___, at ___) sa (URI NG PASILIDAD SA ___)</p><p class="instruction">Enumerator Note: 'Quantified Free Service' fees are those directly charged to the hospital budget.</p><p>113. Which of the following did you use to pay for the hospital bill? (Select all that apply.)</p>
          BCL: |
            <p>) Gusto mi lang maaraman na kun sain ka nakakuha kan pambayad para saimong pagpabulong?</p><p class="instruction">Enumerator Note: 'Quantified Free Service' fees are those directly charged to the hospital budget.</p><p>113. Which of the following did you use to pay for the hospital bill? (Select all that apply.)</p>
          BIS: |
            <p>___) Gusto nako mahibal-an asa ninyo nakuha ang kuwarta nga gigamit sa pagbayad sa medical costs nga nagasto (IN ___, ug ____) sa (FACILITY TYPE IN ___)</p><p class="instruction">Enumerator Note: 'Quantified Free Service' fees are those directly charged to the hospital budget.</p><p>113. Which of the following did you use to pay for the hospital bill? (Select all that apply.)</p>
          CEB: |
            <p>___) Gusto ko mahibaloan kung asa nimo nakuha ang kwarta nga gibayad para sa mga galastohan sa medikal (SA _____, ug ____) sa (KLASE SA PASILIDAD SA _______)</p><p class="instruction">Enumerator Note: 'Quantified Free Service' fees are those directly charged to the hospital budget.</p><p>113. Which of the following did you use to pay for the hospital bill? (Select all that apply.)</p>
          WAR: |
            <p>___) Karuyag ko unta mahibaro kun diin ka nakakuha hin kwarta nga igbabayad han mga gastos ha medisina nga nahimo (HA ___, ngan ____) ha (KLASE HAN PASILIDAD HA ___)</p><p class="instruction">Enumerator Note: 'Quantified Free Service' fees are those directly charged to the hospital budget.</p><p>113. Which of the following did you use to pay for the hospital bill? (Select all that apply.)</p>
          HIL: |
            <p>___) Gusto ko mabalaan kun diin mo nakuha ang kwarta para bayaran ang mga gasto medikal nga nagwa (SA ___, kag ____) sa (KLASE SANG PASILIDAD SA ___)</p><p class="instruction">Enumerator Note: 'Quantified Free Service' fees are those directly charged to the hospital budget.</p><p>113. Which of the following did you use to pay for the hospital bill? (Select all that apply.)</p>
          ILO: |
            <p>___) (Kayatko a maammuan no sadino ti nangalaam iti kuarta a pangbayad kadagiti gastos iti medisina a naaramid (IN ___, ken ____) iti (FACILITY TYPE IN ___)</p><p class="instruction">Enumerator Note: 'Quantified Free Service' fees are those directly charged to the hospital budget.</p><p>113. Which of the following did you use to pay for the hospital bill? (Select all that apply.)</p>
