  - name: PATIENTSURVEY_DICT.Q83_VISIT_REASON
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN: |
            <p>We will now be asking about the patient’s actions taken for health concerns. This includes the type of services and facilities they access for their health and well-being.</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for the Patient’s Health-Seeking Behavior. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies. READ OPTIONS OUT LOUD. SELECT ONE ANSWER ONLY.</p><p>83. What best describes why the patient visited a health facility (e.g. RHU, health center, clinic, hospital)?</p>
          FIL: |
            <p>Magtatanong kami ngayon tungkol sa mga ginawa ng pasyente na pangkalusugan. Kabilang dito ang uri ng mga serbisyong ginagamit at mga pasilidad na pinupuntahan para sa kalusugan at kagalingan.</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for the Patient’s Health-Seeking Behavior. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies. READ OPTIONS OUT LOUD. SELECT ONE ANSWER ONLY.</p><p>83. What best describes why the patient visited a health facility (e.g. RHU, health center, clinic, hospital)?</p>
          BCL: |
            <p>Mahapot naman kami manungod sa pasyente kun ano an saiyang ginibo manungod saiyang mga namamatian</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for the Patient’s Health-Seeking Behavior. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies. READ OPTIONS OUT LOUD. SELECT ONE ANSWER ONLY.</p><p>83. What best describes why the patient visited a health facility (e.g. RHU, health center, clinic, hospital)?</p>
          BIS: |
            <p>Mangutana na usab kami bahin sa mga lihok sa pasyente kung adunay concern sa panglawas</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for the Patient’s Health-Seeking Behavior. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies. READ OPTIONS OUT LOUD. SELECT ONE ANSWER ONLY.</p><p>83. What best describes why the patient visited a health facility (e.g. RHU, health center, clinic, hospital)?</p>
          CEB: |
            <p>We will now be asking about the patient’s actions taken for health concerns. This includes the type of services and facilities they access for their health and well-being.</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for the Patient’s Health-Seeking Behavior. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies. READ OPTIONS OUT LOUD. SELECT ONE ANSWER ONLY.</p><p>83. What best describes why the patient visited a health facility (e.g. RHU, health center, clinic, hospital)?</p>
          WAR: |
            <p>Magpapakiana kami yana han mga aksyon nga ginbuhat han pasyente para han mga kabaraka ha panlawas</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for the Patient’s Health-Seeking Behavior. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies. READ OPTIONS OUT LOUD. SELECT ONE ANSWER ONLY.</p><p>83. What best describes why the patient visited a health facility (e.g. RHU, health center, clinic, hospital)?</p>
          HIL: |
            <p>Subong pamangkuton naton ang pasyente parte sa iya mga ginahimo para sa mga kahangawa sa iya panglawas</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for the Patient’s Health-Seeking Behavior. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies. READ OPTIONS OUT LOUD. SELECT ONE ANSWER ONLY.</p><p>83. What best describes why the patient visited a health facility (e.g. RHU, health center, clinic, hospital)?</p>
          ILO: |
            <p>(Saludsodentayo itan ti maipapan kadagiti tignay ti pasiente nga inaramid para kadagiti pakaseknan iti salun-at</p><p class="instruction">Note to enumerator [do not read]: This section is for the Patient’s Health-Seeking Behavior. Ask all questions in this section unless a skip rule applies. READ OPTIONS OUT LOUD. SELECT ONE ANSWER ONLY.</p><p>83. What best describes why the patient visited a health facility (e.g. RHU, health center, clinic, hospital)?</p>
