  - name: PATIENTSURVEY_DICT.Q152_GAMOT_HEARD
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN: |
            <p>We will now ask about the patient’s awareness about the GAMOT package and the medicines they availed in a GAMOT pharmacy.</p><p class="instruction">Q152 to Q157, Q159 are applicable only to respondents in areas with GAMOT. Otherwise, skip.</p><p>152. Have you heard of the Guaranteed and Accessible Medications for Outpatient Treatment (GAMOT) Package, which is part of PhilHealth's YAKAP/Konsulta or primary care benefit package?</p>
          FIL: |
            <p>Itatanong namin ngayon ang tungkol sa kaalaman ng pasyente sa GAMOT package at sa mga gamot na nakuha sa isang GAMOT pharmacy.</p><p class="instruction">Q152 to Q157, Q159 are applicable only to respondents in areas with GAMOT. Otherwise, skip.</p><p>152. Have you heard of the Guaranteed and Accessible Medications for Outpatient Treatment (GAMOT) Package, which is part of PhilHealth's YAKAP/Konsulta or primary care benefit package?</p>
          BCL: |
            <p>Mahapot naman kami manungod sa kaaraman kan pasyente kan GAMOT package asin medisina na tigkuha sa GAMOT pharmacy</p><p class="instruction">Q152 to Q157, Q159 are applicable only to respondents in areas with GAMOT. Otherwise, skip.</p><p>152. Have you heard of the Guaranteed and Accessible Medications for Outpatient Treatment (GAMOT) Package, which is part of PhilHealth's YAKAP/Konsulta or primary care benefit package?</p>
          BIS: |
            <p>Mangutana na usab kami bahin sa kahibalo sa pasyente sa GAMOT Package ug sa mga tambal nga ilang nakuha gikan sa GAMOT pharmacy</p><p class="instruction">Q152 to Q157, Q159 are applicable only to respondents in areas with GAMOT. Otherwise, skip.</p><p>152. Have you heard of the Guaranteed and Accessible Medications for Outpatient Treatment (GAMOT) Package, which is part of PhilHealth's YAKAP/Konsulta or primary care benefit package?</p>
          CEB: |
            <p>Mangutana na ta karon bahin sa kahibalo sa pasyente sa GAMOT package ug sa mga tambal nga ilang nakuha sa GAMOT nga botika</p><p class="instruction">Q152 to Q157, Q159 are applicable only to respondents in areas with GAMOT. Otherwise, skip.</p><p>152. Have you heard of the Guaranteed and Accessible Medications for Outpatient Treatment (GAMOT) Package, which is part of PhilHealth's YAKAP/Konsulta or primary care benefit package?</p>
          WAR: |
            <p>Magpapakiana kami yana mahitungod han kahibaro han pasyente mahitungod han GAMOT package ngan han mga medisina nga ira gin-avail ha usa nga botika hin GAMOT</p><p class="instruction">Q152 to Q157, Q159 are applicable only to respondents in areas with GAMOT. Otherwise, skip.</p><p>152. Have you heard of the Guaranteed and Accessible Medications for Outpatient Treatment (GAMOT) Package, which is part of PhilHealth's YAKAP/Konsulta or primary care benefit package?</p>
          HIL: |
            <p>Karun pamangkoton naton ang pasyente parte sa iya kahibalo sa GAMOT nga pakete kag sa mga bulong nga iya nakuha sa GAMOT nga botika Q144 to Q149, Q151 are applicable only to respondents in areas with GAMOT</p><p class="instruction">Q152 to Q157, Q159 are applicable only to respondents in areas with GAMOT. Otherwise, skip.</p><p>152. Have you heard of the Guaranteed and Accessible Medications for Outpatient Treatment (GAMOT) Package, which is part of PhilHealth's YAKAP/Konsulta or primary care benefit package?</p>
          ILO: |
            <p>(Saludsodentayo itan ti maipapan iti pannakaammo ti pasiente maipapan iti pakete ti GAMOT ken dagiti agas nga inusarda iti maysa a botika ti GAMOT.) Q144 to Q149, Q151 are applicable only to respondents in areas</p><p class="instruction">Q152 to Q157, Q159 are applicable only to respondents in areas with GAMOT. Otherwise, skip.</p><p>152. Have you heard of the Guaranteed and Accessible Medications for Outpatient Treatment (GAMOT) Package, which is part of PhilHealth's YAKAP/Konsulta or primary care benefit package?</p>
