  - name: PATIENTSURVEY_DICT.Q162_REFERRED
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN: |
            <p>We will be asking about the patient’s experience and satisfaction on referrals.</p><p>162. Based on your most recent visit/confinement at ~~FACILITY_NAME~~, did a healthcare worker refer you to another facility or specialist for further care or specialized care?</p>
          FIL: |
            <p>Tatanungin namin ang karanasan at kasiyahan ng pasyente sa referral.</p><p>162. Based on your most recent visit/confinement at ~~FACILITY_NAME~~, did a healthcare worker refer you to another facility or specialist for further care or specialized care?</p>
          BCL: |
            <p>Mahapot kami manungod eksperyensa asin satisfaction kan pasyente sa referrals</p><p>162. Based on your most recent visit/confinement at ~~FACILITY_NAME~~, did a healthcare worker refer you to another facility or specialist for further care or specialized care?</p>
          BIS: |
            <p>Mangutana kami bahin sa kasinatian ug katagbawan sa pasyente sa referrals</p><p>162. Based on your most recent visit/confinement at ~~FACILITY_NAME~~, did a healthcare worker refer you to another facility or specialist for further care or specialized care?</p>
          CEB: |
            <p>Mangutana kami bahin sa kasinatian ug katagbawan sa pasyente sa mga referral</p><p>162. Based on your most recent visit/confinement at ~~FACILITY_NAME~~, did a healthcare worker refer you to another facility or specialist for further care or specialized care?</p>
          WAR: |
            <p>Magpapakiana kami han eksperyensya ngan kakuntento han pasyente ha mga referral</p><p>162. Based on your most recent visit/confinement at ~~FACILITY_NAME~~, did a healthcare worker refer you to another facility or specialist for further care or specialized care?</p>
          HIL: |
            <p>Mangpamangkot kami parte sa eksperyensya kag kasatisfaksyon sang pasyente sa mga referral</p><p>162. Based on your most recent visit/confinement at ~~FACILITY_NAME~~, did a healthcare worker refer you to another facility or specialist for further care or specialized care?</p>
          ILO: |
            <p>(Saludsodenmi ti maipapan iti kapadasan ken pannakapnek ti pasiente kadagiti referral</p><p>162. Based on your most recent visit/confinement at ~~FACILITY_NAME~~, did a healthcare worker refer you to another facility or specialist for further care or specialized care?</p>
