          FIL: |
            <p>169. Have you visited the referred hospital or facility after the referral was made?</p><p class="instruction">HUWAG BASAHIN NANG MALAKAS ANG MGA PAMIMILIAN. PUMILI LAMANG NG ISANG SAGOT</p>
          BCL: |
