          WAR: |
            <p>169. Have you visited the referred hospital or facility after the referral was made?</p><p class="instruction">AYAW BASAHA HA DAKU NGA TINGOG AN MGA OPSYON. PILI MAUSA LA NGA BATON</p>
          HIL: |
